WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Black Ledger Network war bulletin. Turn 1 -> Turn 2
for Emerald Sprawl: First Pressure.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.600
Turn 1 carried forward the prior public board state.
Turn 2 is the receipt-backed city answer to those
visible pressures. Turn 2 deterministic board keeps
the city public-safe while route pressure shifts
toward recovery, dispatch clarity, and witnessed
closeouts.

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.400
Rust Market runners: Force Rust Bazaar debt into
visible recovery work instead of passive heat.
Recovery is now a live city command, not a backlog
rumor.

4
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.200
Ghostline field GM: Replace rumor spillover with hard
receipt routing before the board loses coherence.
Clean proof routing now determines which factions keep
initiative.

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.000
Free Wardens witness net: Show a public-safe outcome
that visibly changes the city without exposing people.
Public trust now moves because someone closed the
loop, not because a narrator said so.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.800
Black Ledger dispatch desk: Turn turn-one chaos into
concrete recovery lanes the player can chase. Package
fights are now legible command work instead of ambient
world flavor.

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.600
Ashline Circle crews: Seize the public frame before
rumor merchants can narrate the awakened spike.
Ashline now controls whether strange pressure reads as
threat or competence.

8
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.400
Black Ledger Network: Reopen the city as a live
command deck, not a teaser screen. Every downstream
lane inherits its urgency from this turn-open.

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.200
rust market syndicate: Recovery crews converted Rust
Bazaar debt pressure into visible closeout work.

10
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.000
ghostline network: Ghostline published cleaner receipt
routing before rumor spillover reached the public
board.

11
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.800
Rust Bazaar is the hottest visible district at 77
heat. Rust Bazaar moved the hardest this turn with
delta 8.

12
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.633
Witnessed, routed, and ready for inspection.
